      "id": "google-2",
      "author": "Nir Ingbar",
      "source": "google",
      "rating": 5,
      "language": "en",
      "full_text": "Our family had the most wonderful time riding the EZ-raider vehicle with Voy PRO Budapest. We took the evening  tour with our two daughters, ages 17 and 12. The vehicle is very stable and it takes approximately one minute to understand how to operate it. The tour instructor, Juda, was  knowledgeable, explaining about the city and pointing out the main attractions. The city is so beautifully lit during the nighttime so it was such a different experience from touring the exact attractions from daytime. Our daughters were so thrilled about the tour and so were we - it was definitely one of the highlights of our trip to Budapest!",
      "date": "2024-09-01",
